WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.720
Let's recap. Today, you moved from discovery to architecture. You took the powerful insights

00:08.720 --> 00:15.360
about yourself and forged them into the first draft of your M.V.P. blueprint, your mission,

00:16.080 --> 00:23.280
vision, and purpose. You were also introduced to the 90-Day Way, the operating system you will

00:23.280 --> 00:31.680
use to execute that blueprint. This is a monumental step. Your homework is to continue

00:31.680 --> 00:39.040
refining your M.V.P. statements in your playbook. Live with them. Put them on. See how they feel.

00:39.760 --> 00:46.240
They don't have to be perfect, but they need to feel true. Read them out loud. Does it sound

00:46.320 --> 00:53.040
like you? This is an iterative process and anticipate several drafts before you anchor

00:53.040 --> 01:00.320
in on your final draft. In our next lesson, we will begin to activate this plan. We'll talk

01:00.320 --> 01:06.560
about conditioning your resilience and agility to overcome the resistance you will inevitably face

01:06.560 --> 01:14.640
as you start to make bold moves. You have your game plan. Now it's time to prepare to execute.

01:14.640 --> 01:17.565
You've got this. Make it happen.

01:17.565 --> 01:28.220
Keep up the momentum. I'll see you soon.
